@startuml API-Gateway State Machine
[*] --> RequestReceived

state "Request Received" as RequestReceived
state "Logging Request" as LogRequest
state "Route Matching" as RouteMatch
state "Circuit Breaker Check" as CircuitCheck
state "Forward to Orchestrator" as Forward
state "Fallback Controller" as Fallback
state "Receive Response" as ReceiveResponse
state "Logging Response" as LogResponse

RequestReceived --> LogRequest : LoggingFilter\n(Order = -1)
LogRequest --> RouteMatch : Log method & path

RouteMatch --> CircuitCheck : Match:\n/api/v1/orchestrator/**

state CircuitCheck {
  [*] --> Closed

  state "CLOSED" as Closed
  state "HALF_OPEN" as HalfOpen
  state "OPEN" as Open

  Closed --> HalfOpen : Failure rate > 50%\n(min 10 calls)
  HalfOpen --> Closed : Test successful
  HalfOpen --> Open : Test failed
  Open --> HalfOpen : Wait 10s elapsed
}

Closed --> Forward : Circuit healthy
HalfOpen --> Forward : Test request
Open --> Fallback : Circuit broken

Forward --> ReceiveResponse : Orchestrator\nresponse
Fallback --> ReceiveResponse : Fallback\nresponse

ReceiveResponse --> LogResponse : Response received
LogResponse --> [*] : Return to client

note right of RouteMatch
  URI: http://orchestrator:8082
  Predicate: Path=/api/v1/orchestrator/**
  Filters:
  - CircuitBreaker
  - Headers (X-Gateway-Request)
end note

note right of CircuitCheck
  Resilience4j Configuration:
  - Sliding window: 50 calls
  - Failure threshold: 50%
  - Wait duration: 10s
end note

note right of Fallback
  Forward to:
  /fallback/orchestrator

  (FallbackController)
end note

@enduml
